8,1,1,talk,May,,Let's not repeat old mistakes. I'll look into two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I worry about the staff. I'll check the volunteer register and supervision training, and neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
