30,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The grant only covers the first year. That is a risk. Also, road closures north of the river happened eleven days last winter.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Yumi,,The outer wards lost their bus links! People have to travel an hour now. But old outreach stops were actually very popular.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,George,,"I see the grant issue too. Also, the vehicle running costs overran by a third last year, while equipment stayed under budget.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,"Those outreach stops really did draw crowds. Interestingly, a digitisation project from six years ago failed, but partner-run groups are still going.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We have retired tradespeople volunteering, but no staff are trained to supervise outside facilitators. Also, our tool certification expert retired.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, if vehicle costs are overrunning, a mobile service might be unstable. @Yumi, the road closures make a vehicle even more unreliable.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, but the people in those wards are stranded. We have to reach them somehow if they can't use the bus.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,George,,@Ryuji is right about the budget. The way the grant is shaped means we'll hit a wall in year two.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,May,,"@Yumi, if the partner-run groups survived six years, maybe we should look for something that relies on community partners rather than our own staff.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, that sounds okay, but @George, if we don't have supervisors, who manages those partners?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,We need a solution that doesn't collapse when the weather turns or the grant ends.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Yumi,,But we can't just ignore the people who can't reach the library. It's not fair.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,George,,"I agree with Yumi's sentiment, but we must be realistic about the funding cycle.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,May,,The data shows that community-led models are the only ones that actually lasted here.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm just worried we're adding more work to people who aren't trained for it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
