55,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The candidates are Language Learning Circles, Digital Archive Portal, Maker Workshop, and Mobile Branch Service. I cannot support the Mobile service.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Yumi,,The Mobile Branch Service is exactly what those outer wards need! They have no buses.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,George,,"The Mobile service is too expensive to run, and the grant won't cover it long-term. I prefer the Language Circles.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,May,,The Digital Archive failed once before. The Maker Workshop needs a technician we don't have. I vote for Language Learning Circles.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,The Maker Workshop sounds scary without a certified technician. Language Circles seem safer if partners help.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,Language Learning Circles rely on partner organizations. That reduces our direct risk and matches the successful old models.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Yumi,,But the Language Circles are in the buildings! The people in the outer wards still can't get to them.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, we can't implement a service that bankrupts us by the second year.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,May,,"@Yumi, the records show partner-run groups are the most resilient. Let's go with the Circles.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. It's better than overloading the staff with a workshop they can't supervise.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with the Language Learning Circles. It is the most rational choice.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Yumi,,"I still feel for the outer wards, but if everyone else is against the mobile service...","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,George,,It is the most sustainable path forward.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,May,,It's a proven shape for this system.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll go with the majority.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
